"With $420K revenue last quarter and strong month-to-month revenue coverage of operating costs, we are positioned to scale efficiently. Our immediate priorities are tightening professional services to product handoff, executing targeted upsell campaigns to increase expansion revenue, and reducing gross churn. Hitting a 10–15% QoQ revenue growth target while maintaining NRR > 105% will allow us to extend runway and accelerate go-to-market investments."

