- Annualized run rate = 420K × 4 = $1.68M
- If starting revenue = $400K, churned = $20K, expansion = $40K → GRR = (400–20)/400 = 95%; NRR = (400 + 40 - 20) / 400 = 105%

Finance narrative framework (concise, investor/internal friendly)
1. Executive summary (1–2 bullets)
   - Current quarter revenue, QoQ/YoY growth, cash, runway (clarify calculation)
