- Customer churn rate (logo churn):
  - = (Number of customers lost during period) / (Customers at start of period).
- Revenue churn (gross revenue churn):
  - = (MRR lost from churned customers during period) / (MRR at start of period).
- Gross Revenue Retention (GRR):
  - = 1 − revenue_churn (or revenue retained from existing customers / starting revenue, excluding expansions).
- Net Revenue Retention (NRR):
  - = (Starting revenue + expansions − contractions − churn) / Starting revenue
