- ARPU (average revenue per user/customer):
  - = Revenue / Active customers (over same period).
- LTV (customer lifetime value) estimate:
  - = ARPU * Gross margin (%) / Monthly churn rate (or ARPU / churn_rate if using revenue retention).
- LTV : CAC ratio:
  - = LTV / Customer Acquisition Cost.
