3) Revenue growth metrics to track (formulas + why they matter)
- Quarterly Revenue Growth Rate = (ThisQuarter − LastQuarter) / LastQuarter
- Monthly Growth Rate = (Month_t − Month_t−1) / Month_t−1
- CAGR (useful for multi-quarter/annual reviews) = (End / Start)^(1/n) − 1
