2) Revenue growth metrics you should calculate (formulas + data needed)
- Quarter-over-Quarter (QoQ) growth = (ThisQuarterRevenue − LastQuarterRevenue) / LastQuarterRevenue
  - Need: last quarter revenue(s).
- Year-over-Year (YoY) growth = (ThisQuarterRevenue − SameQuarterLastYearRevenue) / SameQuarterLastYearRevenue
  - Need: same quarter last year.
- Monthly growth rate (if you report monthly): (ThisMonth − PriorMonth) / PriorMonth
- CAGR (if showing multi-quarter trends): (EndValue / StartValue)^(1/periods) − 1
- Required growth to hit break-even revenue: needed_monthly_revenue = burn (gross). % increase = (needed_monthly_revenue − current_monthly_revenue) / current_monthly_revenue.

