- CAC = Total acquisition spend / New customers acquired.
- CAC payback = CAC / (Average revenue per customer per month) — months to recover CAC.
- LTV = Gross margin % × (Average revenue per customer per month × (1 / monthly churn)).
  - Data needed: marketing & sales spend, new customers, gross margin, average revenue per customer.

7) Efficiency metrics
- Burn multiple = Net burn over period / ARR net new added over same period. Lower is better (benchmark: <1.5–2 for high-quality growth).
