- Upside: improved retention or growth scenarios and how much runway or fundraising they avoid.

Benchmarks / targets to call out in the narrative (adjust if you’re a services business)
- NRR: aim >100% (or at least >95%).
- GRR: >85–90%.
- CAC payback: <12 months (for SaaS).
